# Mimeoplasm exiles Psychic Frog as it enters and becomes a copy of it, then pays the copied Frog's "Exile three cards from
# your graveyard" with Grizzly Bears and both Entombs. A card exiled to pay a cost of its ability is one it exiled, so the
# owner's ruling (jschibel, 2026-11-24) - "exiled with it" reads every creature card this object exiled, however it
# exiled it - lets it become a copy of that Bears: a 0/0 with three +1/+1 counters.
